{"unit_id":"Zhiyi-Zhao__dsh-notify#card-zh","repo":"Zhiyi-Zhao/dsh-notify","commit":"22ead96484eba7e879874e6a7e257745ab3307a3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-notify 是一款面向 DSH Web 与桌面客户端的系统通知插件。它通过浏览器 Notification API 将会话状态转成操作系统通知，提醒用户回到 DSH。主要功能包括提示运行较久的会话完成、报告会话错误、通知后台任务完成或失败，以及提醒用户处理待确认交互；点击通知会聚焦窗口，并在客户端支持时打开对应会话。插件会合并同一运行的结束与错误或待确认提示，并可过滤前台窗口和过短运行。普通浏览器需在首次用户操作后授予通知权限；通知选项保存在 localStorage，不需要 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:20-46","src/client/index.ts:237-269","src/client/index.ts:290-328","src/client/triggers.ts:95-189"]}
{"unit_id":"Zhiyi-Zhao__dsh-notify#card-en","repo":"Zhiyi-Zhao/dsh-notify","commit":"22ead96484eba7e879874e6a7e257745ab3307a3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-notify alerts DSH users when sessions finish or fail, jobs settle, or agents need confirmation. It uses browser notifications, focuses the window on click, and opens the session when supported. Regular browsers request permission after a user gesture; options are stored in localStorage.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:20-46","src/client/index.ts:237-269","src/client/index.ts:290-328","src/client/triggers.ts:95-189"]}
